        <mxCell id="extpanel" value="&lt;b&gt;Liên kết ra phân hệ khác (FK)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Line xanh dương → user · tím → owner_tenant · cam → property. Chân quạ + vòng tròn = 0..N; gạch đơn = 1.&lt;br&gt;• owner_tenant.id ← audit_event.tenant_id, file_object.tenant_id, notification.tenant_id, idempotency_key.tenant_id&lt;br&gt;• property.id ← notification.property_id&lt;br&gt;• user.id ← audit_event.actor_user_id, file_object.uploaded_by, notification.recipient_id, notification.sent_by, device_token.user_id, idempotency_key.user_id&lt;br&gt;• lease_revision.id ← audit_event.lease_revision_id (BRD v1.8; không vẽ stub để giữ layout gọn)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
